        <activityName xml:lang="en">Single-Si wafer, photovoltaics, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Single-Si wafer, photovoltaics, at regional storage
Imports of wafers are not taken into account since domestic wafer production is sufficient to cover cell production.;
Synonyms: Solarmodul, PV-module, cadmium telluride, thin film; 
UUID: c6ca3a00-6ae4-34d8-a212-8ea058f5e723
Domestic production and imports of single-crystalline silicon wafers used in photovoltaic cell production in the US and other American countries. Transport from different world regions to regional storage.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: None
Time period: Data refer to 2018
Production volume: na
Sampling: Survey among market intelligence companies 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c6ca3a00-6ae4-34d8-a212-8ea058f5e723.xml</text>
